# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Panther Mastery (193), Raptor Mastery (196).
# Since 2026-11-07 Stranglethorn is done in two visits around Desolace: this first loop at 33-35, the second
# (30-40/04b) at 35-36. Its Booty Bay and Rebel Camp quests up to 37 are taken here, where their givers stand.
# Since the 0.3.7 audit: Bookie Herod's Records (200) are handed in and The Hidden Key (328) taken on this loop's Kurzen
# stop, Krazek's Cookery (210) goes from Corporal Kaleb to Krazek on it, and the top-up to 34 is three short steps on
# the loop's own quest mobs (Stranglethorn Tigers, Kurzen Jungle Fighters, elder tigers) instead of one block.

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Wetlands
  goto 9.5,59.7 "Menethil Harbor flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 35.7,10.5 "Nesingwary's Expedition"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's Expedition

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip From Duskwood take the road south into Stranglethorn; the hunters' tents stand just west of the road past the Rebel Camp turn-off.
  accept 583                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 583                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 5762                         -- Hemet Nesingwary, from Thousand Needles
  accept 194
  accept 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 338 optional                 -- Barnil Stonepot

step Young tigers and panthers
  tip Both roam the grass around the camp and along the road north.
  kill 681 quest 185                  -- Young Stranglethorn Tiger

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 186

step Young Panther
  kill 683 quest 190                  -- Young Panther

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 191

step Stranglethorn Tigers
  tip The adult tigers prowl the hills just south and west of the camp.
  kill 682 quest 186                  -- Stranglethorn Tiger

step Level 33.2
  when level<33.2
  tip The jungle's quests climb to 37 from here: short of 33.2? Keep on the Stranglethorn Tigers in the hills just south and west of the camp until level 33.2. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library) instead.
  goto 30.8,11.2 map 1434 "Stranglethorn Tiger"
  level 33.2 grind 682                 -- grind on Stranglethorn Tiger

step Ajeck Rouack
  turnin 186
  accept 187                          -- The elder tigers come later, on the way back from the Rebel Camp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's hunts

step Panthers, raptors and elder tigers
  tip Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west.
  kill 736 quest 191                  -- Panther
  accept 635 optional                 -- Gluggle, a rare murloc on the coast west of camp, drops the Pendant of Myzrael: take it if you meet him

step Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  tip Back east to Nesingwary's camp on the way north to the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 191

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  tip Take the road north; the camp sits in the hills to the west.
  tip Private Thorsen spends most of his time at the top of the Rebel Camp's path, by the huts, and now and then walks down it to the road and back (about eight minutes). If he isn't at the arrow, look along that path.
  accept 215 @38.0,3.4                -- Private Thorsen
  turnin 215                          -- Lieutenant Doren, in the hut
  accept 200                          -- Lieutenant Doren: Bookie Herod's records lie at the edge of Kurzen's Compound, next
  accept 210                          -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay, later in this guide
  accept 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 204

step Kurzen's Compound: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Kurzen rebels hold the camp east of the Rebel Camp; work its outer edge, where Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men stand, and loot the supply crates by the tents. Bookie Herod's records lie in a hut on the compound's west side.
  turnin 200                          -- Bookie Herod's Records, in the hut
  accept 328                          -- The strongbox is deeper in, by the cave: on the northern loop (04b)
  collect 2633 quest 204.1            -- Jungle Remedy
  kill 937 quest 203                  -- Kurzen Jungle Fighter
  collect 2634 quest 204.2            -- Venom Fern Extract, from a Kurzen Supplies crate

step Level 33.6
  when level<33.6
  tip Short of 33.6? Keep on the Kurzen Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men around the compound's outer edge until level 33.6. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library) instead.
  goto 44.6,10.0 map 1434 "Kurzen Jungle Fighter"
  level 33.6 grind 937                 -- grind on Kurzen Jungle Fighter

step Rebel Camp
  turnin 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 204

step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly.
  tip Careful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults.
  kill 1085 quest 187                 -- Elder Stranglethorn Tiger
  kill 685 quest 194                  -- Stranglethorn Raptor

step Level 34
  when level<34
  tip The quests from here on are 37: if you are short of 34, keep on the elder tigers in the hills south-west of Nesingwary's camp until level 34. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library or Armory) instead.
  goto 33.2,18.7 map 1434 "Elder Stranglethorn Tiger"
  level 34 grind 1085                  -- grind on Elder Stranglethorn Tiger

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Barnil collects the Green Hills of Stranglethorn: the pages drop from almost every humanoid in the jungle. Turn the pages into chapters as you go.
  accept 339 optional
  accept 340 optional
  accept 341 optional
  accept 342 optional
  turnin 187                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 188
  turnin 194                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  accept 195

step Sin'Dall and the Lashtail raptors
  tip Sin'Dall, the great tiger, lairs on the hilltop south-west of the camp; Lashtail Raptors run south of it, along the way to Booty Bay.
  kill 686 quest 195                  -- Lashtail Raptor

