# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Desolace

step Fly to Astranaar
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"
  zone Ashenvale

step Heartswood
  only Warlock
  zone Ashenvale
  tip From Astranaar head north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. If you took What Is Love?, the Wooden Figurine lies in a house among the trees north of Maestra's Post (26.6,22.0). Then take the road west to Stonetalon.
  collect 6912 quest 1738.1               -- Heartswood
  collect 190309 quest 65602.1 optional   -- Wooden Figurine, north of Maestra's Post

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  goto 33.7,72.8 "The road to Nijel's Point"

